==Arabic==

===Verb===
{{ar-verb (old)|I|مَسَكَ|másaka}}

# to [[grab]], [[grasp]], [[clutch]], [[clasp]], [[seize]], [[take hold]]
# to [[hold]]
# to [[stick]], [[cling]], [[adhere]], [[hang on]]
# to [[keep]] ''(the books, accounts, etc.)''
# to [[take]] ''(charge, control, etc.)''

{{ar-verb (old)|II|مَسَّكَ|mássaka}}

# to [[scent]] with [[musk]]
# to have someone [[seize]] or [[hold]] something

{{ar-verb (old)|IV|أمْسَكَ|’ámsaka}}

# to [[seize]], [[grasp]], [[clutch]], [[grip]], [[hold]]
# to [[hold]] [[fast]], [[grab]]
# to [[hold back]], [[keep]], [[detain]], [[restrain]]
# to [[withhold]]
# to [[abstain]], [[refrain]], [[desist]], [[cease]]

{{ar-verb (old)|V|تَمَسّكَ|tamássaka}}

# to [[hold on]], [[hold]] [[fast]], [[clutch]]
# to [[stick]], [[cling]], [[cleave]]
# to [[hang on]], [[persist]]
# to [[keep]]
# to [[rise]], [[harden]], [[firm up]]

{{ar-verb (old)|VI|تَمَاسَكَ|tamá:saka}}

# to [[hold]] [[together]], be firmly [[connect]]ed, be [[interlock]]ed
# to [[compose]] oneself, to pull oneself together
# to remain [[undaunted]], remain [[calm]], be [[composed]]

{{ar-verb (old)|X|اِسْتَمْسَكَ|istámsaka}}

# to [[keep]], [[stick]], [[cling]], [[adhere]]
# to [[grab]], [[seize]]
# to [[refrain]], [[abstain]]

